---

---

<header
  class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center text-center"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-600/20 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700/50 text-slate-300 text-sm mb-8">
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
    v0.0.1-beta.2 (C++17 / Native JSI)
  </div>

  <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl">
    <span data-i18n="landing.hero.title_start">Seguridad Zero-Trust para</span>
    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-cyan-400"
      ><span data-i18n="landing.hero.title_end">React Native</span></span
    >
  </h1>

  <p
    class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed"
    data-i18n="landing.hero.subtitle"
  >
    Librería criptográfica de grado empresarial compilada nativamente. Firmas DPoP asimétricas y
    limpieza de memoria estricta (Zeroization) operando por debajo del motor V8/Hermes mediante JSI
    Bridge.
  </p>

  <div class="flex gap-4">
    <a
      href="#quickstart"
      class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/20"
      data-i18n="landing.hero.doc_btn">Ver Documentación</a
    >
    <a
      href="/register"
      class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white border border-slate-700 font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all"
      data-i18n="landing.hero.bundle_btn">Generar Bundle ID</a
    >
  </div>
</header>
